      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Fort Rouillé, built in 1750, was abandoned by 1759, and later Fort York guarded the harbour’s eastern entrance.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
