      ],
      "source": "https://www.waterfrontoronto.ca/about-us/history-heritage",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "After Beijing won the 2008 Olympics, a task force led by Robert Fung pledged Waterfront Toronto’s revitalization regardless of the bid.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.waterfrontoronto.ca/about-us/history-heritage",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Once a bustling industrial hub, the area now hosts museums, galleries, and waterfront parks celebrating its heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
